From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lz4kds-port <lz4kds@crystalfrostwork>
Date: Sat, 15 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: add crystalfrostwork lz4kds (lz4kd+sddc+zms) for GKI 6.12.69

Port lz4kds (Crystal Hybridswap with SDDC+ZMS+LZ4KD private backend) from
Wcoom/oneplus_sm8750_kernel 6.6.118-13T to Android GKI 6.12.69 kernel tree.

This module provides:
  - lz4kds: private LZ4KD codec with per-stream delta window (lz4kd+sddc)
  - Crystal Hybridswap: SDDC-aware zram replacement driver with ZMS writeback
  - crystalfrostwork framework: sysfs copyright node

Requires: CONFIG_ZRAM=n (conflicts), CONFIG_BLOCK, CONFIG_MEMCG
Supports: SM8850 (GKI 6.12.69) and any arm64 4KiB-page GKI build

NOTE: drivers/Kconfig and drivers/Makefile hook lines are injected by the
build workflow (sed/echo), NOT by this patch, to avoid context mismatch.
---

